flow:            hardDeletePersona({ id, slug }) → getSession() → hardDeletePersonaSchema
                 → findFirst({ id, deletedAt: { not: null } }) → refus si absent,
                 non-supprimé, ou slug ne correspond pas → assertProjectAccess →
